untie,Asher was able to tie and untie a string while sitting on the trampoline.
oboe,An oboe is a nice musical instrument.
skies,Blue skies all around is a beautiful mental picture.
true,The opposite of false is true.
argue,When you argue be sure you are kind.
fried,Fried food is usually not very good for you.
chief,The chief of the tribe was obviously in charge.
avenue,The highway from St Paul to St Louis is called the avenue of the saints.
aloe,I have a lot of aloe vera plants.
