rescue,Food rescue means to keep food from going to waste.
belief,It is my belief that Asher is fun and cool.
foes,If you have enemies they could be called your foes.
revenue,If you sell a lot of lemonade you are making some sweet revenue.
cookie,Zoey likes to make cookies with cookie dough.
